    fact("⛪", n("Ogni festa trasforma il quartiere", "Each feast transforms its neighbourhood", "Chaque festa transforme son quartier", "Cada festa transforma su barrio"), n("Bandiere, luci, bande e fuochi d'artificio accompagnano le feste patronali, soprattutto tra primavera e fine estate.", "Flags, lights, bands and fireworks accompany patron saint feasts, especially from spring to late summer.", "Drapeaux, lumières, fanfares et feux accompagnent les fêtes patronales, surtout du printemps à la fin de l'été.", "Banderas, luces, bandas y fuegos acompañan las fiestas patronales, sobre todo de primavera a final de verano.")),
